---
Monetization is driven by membership plans ('Guardian Member' and 'Verified Partner') with flexible billing intervals.

## Billing
- Members choose monthly, yearly, or one-time at checkout (admin-controlled per service)
- Yearly billing includes a configurable discount (default 20%), stored in `site_settings` key `yearly_discount_percent`
- Monthly & Yearly use Stripe auto-recurring subscriptions (mode: "subscription")
- One-Time uses Stripe single payment (mode: "payment")
- `membership_plans` table has `price` (yearly) and `monthly_price` (monthly, 0 = auto-calculate from yearly/12)
- `memberships` table tracks `billing_interval`, `stripe_subscription_id`, `stripe_customer_id`

## Service Pricing Configuration (site_settings)
- `service_billing_<service>` = comma-separated allowed billing types (monthly,yearly,one_time)
- `service_price_<service>_monthly`, `_yearly`, `_one_time` = prices per service
- Services: membership, flyer, certificate, directory
- Admin configures all from Payment Settings page

## Flyer Builder Access
- Supports monthly/yearly subscriptions and one-time via `flyer_subscriptions` table
- Legacy keys: `flyer_monthly_price`, `flyer_yearly_price` (synced with new service_price keys)

## Stripe Webhook
- `stripe-webhook` edge function handles: checkout.session.completed (subscriptions + one-time), invoice.paid (renewal), customer.subscription.deleted (cancel), customer.subscription.updated (past_due)

## Admin Controls
- Payment Settings page has per-service billing mode checkboxes and price inputs
- Admin can enable/disable monthly, yearly, one-time per service
- Service Subscriptions page shows all subscriptions with billing interval column
- Admin can toggle status on/off for any subscription
